{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はチップのお散歩に\nお父さんとお母さんといったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに行ったけど\nたのしかったなあああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チップが最近冷たい！なんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/05/1074795/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/05/1074795/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんで素敵な写真"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チップちゃんだいすき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/05/1074795/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"武道館まで残り2日！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年はアンダーメンバーとして\nアンダーメンバー単独で立たせてもらった\n武道館。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は選抜メンバーとして\n初の選抜単独ライブを武道館で\nやらせてもらいます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年の武道館はたくさん泣いた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーメンバーだけで\n立たせてもらえたり\nフロントメンバーとしてみんなを引っ張ったり、\n嫉妬の権利もあつかったよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場一面が真っ赤に燃えてた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんさんの卒業発表があったり。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そーだなーなんだろー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"簡単にたてる場所じゃないと思うから\n私は大事に噛み締めて\n当日ステージにたちます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年の私より成長していたいけど\nあの時の気持ちは忘れたくない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/05/1074795/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/05/1074795/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/05/1074795/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"週刊プレイボーイ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11月24日  発売中！\nみなみちゃんとふわふわツインテール\nペアグラビア！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月刊エンタメ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11月30日  発売中！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絢音とみり愛と3人で2016年を振り返る\n取材をしてもらいました！\n冬眠前にみてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"漫画アクション"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月6日  発売！\n漫画雑誌 初・ソロ表紙！\n冬っぽく、だけどいつもの私らしく\n元気な感じでとってもらいました！\n衣装も全部かわいくて撮影も動物園などにいって楽しかったよ！\n絶対みてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヤングマガジン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月12日  発売！\n飛鳥とひめちゃんと未央奈と4人で\n撮影をしてもらいました！\nナチュラルで抜け感のあるグラビアに\nなってると思います！みてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"EX大衆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月15日  発売！\n七瀬さんと2人で取材してもらいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"活動の話しとかお悩み相談させてもらったり、\nいろいろお話ししました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堂本兄弟 クリスマスSP"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月16日  放送！\nサヨナラの意味を披露させてもらいました！\nトークもあったり、内容盛りだくさんです♪\nみてね(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Zipper"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月23日   発売！\nWINTER号が発売されます！\n今回もある企画とひなコレに出させてもらってます♪みてね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/05/1074795/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あした、有線大賞みてねっ♪"}],"source":"archive"}